  "content": "\n\n<h3><strong>展示</strong></h3>\n<hr>\n<p><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yrfJf8dtMT0\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>關於</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Solas 是一款奇幻風格的着色器包，旨在以適度的性能消耗提供驚豔的視覺效果。展示該着色器的截圖可於<strong>畫廊</strong>章節中找到。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>重要連結</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Discord</strong> / <strong>Boosty</strong> / <strong>GitHub</strong> / <strong>Solas 官網</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/HEw9DbQwuM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d234075cc17cb6c22bf98b9cc8fe8eebd94fbd79.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fseptonious\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cfe4a1b9941ac06b97c9ac500e5309eb55f5aa7c_0.webp\" alt=\"Boosty（類似 **Patreon**）\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Septonious/Solas-Shader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3c32d50653361cff2c6c84383484ae0ee1a75f16_0.webp\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsolasshader.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a6a1da17ab9578d1777b538938d7225fee8ad3d2_0.webp\" alt=\"Solas 着色器官網\"></a></p>\n<p>正在尋找<strong>獨特</strong>、<strong>高品質</strong>的原版 RPG<strong>伺服器</strong>嗎？來看看我的新專案——<strong>Ardonia</strong>！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fardonia.xyz%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/62307f57f1cc4692b35e720aa2b745b006442730_0.webp\" alt=\"Ardonia\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>主要功能</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>進階光照</strong><ul>\n<li>方塊著色光照</li>\n<li>即時陰影，洞穴內無光滲漏</li>\n<li>雲層陰影</li>\n<li>特定方塊的次表面散射</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>高品質體積光照</strong><ul>\n<li>3D 雲朵、耶穌光、螢火蟲、地獄煙霧、終界原行星盤</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>美麗的天空特效</strong><ul>\n<li>極光、銀河、終界星雲與黑洞、彩虹</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>可自訂後處理</strong><ul>\n<li>精細調整的色調映射、泛光、鏡頭光暈、色差、景深、動態模糊、移軸效果</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>逼真水面</strong><ul>\n<li>程序化波浪、焦散、光線吸收與折射</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>內建 PBR 資源包</strong><ul>\n<li>發光貼圖、反射材質與程序化生成的法線貼圖</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>支援 PBR 資源包</strong><ul>\n<li>同時支援<strong>LabPBR</strong>與<strong>OldPBR/SeusPBR</strong>格式</li>\n<li>請在着色器設定中開啟\"<strong>PBR 資源包</strong>\"！</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>模組相容性</strong>&nbsp;<ul>\n<li>Voxy</li>\n<li>Distant Horizons</li>\n<li>Iris Shaders（推薦載入器）</li>\n<li>OptiFine（不支援自訂天空盒與方塊著色光照）</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>致謝</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>EminGT</strong> 與 <strong>gri573</strong> 改進了陰影採樣。</li>\n<li><strong>SixthSurge</strong> 提供體素化與光線傳播演算法。</li>\n<li><strong>Capt Tatsu</strong> 提供抗鋸齒及部分 BSL 程式碼。</li>\n<li><strong>社群成員</strong> 以不同方式為 Solas 做出貢獻。</li>\n</ul>",
